WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.541
- Thank you to the Salt Lakes for welcoming us to All-Hero Weekend.

00:00:03.541 --> 00:00:06.916
As a special treat, taverns will be open till 8 p.m.

00:00:06.916 --> 00:00:08.666
- I've never got so many cheers!

00:00:08.666 --> 00:00:10.041
I'm so excited.

00:00:10.416 --> 00:00:11.416
- Why's Steph here?

00:00:11.416 --> 00:00:13.541
Everyone knows I was brought in to replace him.

00:00:15.666 --> 00:00:17.333
- He thinks he can replace me.

00:00:17.708 --> 00:00:18.291
Cute.

00:00:18.291 --> 00:00:19.166
[Growling]

00:00:19.166 --> 00:00:22.125
- Look, LeBron's courting the second-hottest young guard.

00:00:22.125 --> 00:00:23.791
[Whispering]

00:00:23.791 --> 00:00:26.125
- But King, you already have DLo.

00:00:26.125 --> 00:00:29.500
- LeBron, step away from the impressionable young star.

00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:33.625
- Thanks, Dame. I almost had to go to a place 
with pressure and expectations.

00:00:33.916 --> 00:00:36.208
- I've battled too many superteams.

00:00:36.208 --> 00:00:38.041
Some less super than others.

00:00:38.041 --> 00:00:42.541
And I vow no superteams will form this All-Hero Weekend.

00:00:42.541 --> 00:00:44.291
- Not this loyalty s--t again.

00:00:44.291 --> 00:00:47.291
♪♪♪ Born to be a hero ♪♪♪

00:00:47.291 --> 00:00:50.333
♪♪♪ Riaru-sa misetayo ♪♪♪

00:00:50.333 --> 00:00:53.291
♪♪♪ Born to be a legend ♪♪♪

00:00:53.291 --> 00:00:56.541
♪♪♪ Hikari o mezashite ♪♪♪

00:00:56.541 --> 00:01:03.458
♪♪♪ Born to be a hero ♪♪♪

00:01:14.250 --> 00:01:15.916
[Saxophone Rat squeaks]

00:01:16.416 --> 00:01:16.916
- Hmm.

00:01:18.666 --> 00:01:22.041
- I've used it many times, it's never failed me.

00:01:22.041 --> 00:01:26.041
- LeBron! Aw, did I ruin another one of your trades?

00:01:26.041 --> 00:01:30.125
- [Chuckling] Maybe it's me, or maybe it's you.

00:01:30.125 --> 00:01:32.916
- [Groaning] [Wall crumbles]

00:01:33.791 --> 00:01:35.291
- I know you think you clutch.

00:01:36.416 --> 00:01:38.041
I'll show you clutch.

00:01:38.416 --> 00:01:40.333
- Dame, calm down.

00:01:40.333 --> 00:01:41.916
You're not supposed to activate it.

00:01:41.916 --> 00:01:43.958
Not at All-Hero Weekend.

00:01:43.958 --> 00:01:46.416
- [Announcer:] Welcome back to the celebrity All-Hero game.

00:01:46.416 --> 00:01:48.583
Post Malone struggles down the court, and-

00:01:48.583 --> 00:01:49.916
[Energy burst]

00:01:49.916 --> 00:01:50.916
- Oh, nice beam.

00:01:53.416 --> 00:01:55.791
- It's... Dame Time.

00:01:55.791 --> 00:01:57.750
May God have mercy on us all.

00:02:01.083 --> 00:02:02.166
[Whispering]

00:02:02.166 --> 00:02:05.000
- [Dame:] No. More. Hand covering mouth...

00:02:05.000 --> 00:02:06.833
[Energy charging]
Whispering things!

00:02:07.541 --> 00:02:09.541
Bombs away! [Blasting]

00:02:09.541 --> 00:02:10.666
- [Grunting]

00:02:12.166 --> 00:02:13.916
[Muffled explosions]
I knew this would happen.

00:02:13.916 --> 00:02:15.916
Before I came here, I knew this would happen.

00:02:16.166 --> 00:02:17.666
- [Echoing] Sixteen bars.

00:02:22.333 --> 00:02:24.916
[Wooshing]
- Dame, you're right about superteams.

00:02:25.250 --> 00:02:27.958
Everyone should follow the old ways of heartbreaking losses.

00:02:28.875 --> 00:02:30.000
- Heh.

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:30.916
[Glass shattering]
- Hah!

00:02:30.916 --> 00:02:32.416
[Sand cascading]

00:02:32.416 --> 00:02:33.708
- Sorry, Dame.

00:02:33.708 --> 00:02:35.208
You were destroying the Salt Lakes,

00:02:35.208 --> 00:02:37.083
And none of us wanna be part of that rebuild.

00:02:37.083 --> 00:02:38.791
[Crowd cheering]

00:02:39.625 --> 00:02:40.833
- [Announcer:] Wow!

00:02:40.833 --> 00:02:42.750
Best All-Hero Weekend yet.

00:02:43.458 --> 00:02:45.208
- Nice bag of tricks you got there.

00:02:45.208 --> 00:02:47.083
- Woah, careful. No superteams.

00:02:47.083 --> 00:02:48.833
[Laughing]

00:02:50.708 --> 00:02:52.583
- [LeBron:] I've used it many times,

00:02:52.583 --> 00:02:53.708
It's never failed me.

